  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Anges RF is a precision micro-needling device that utilizes radiofrequency (RF) to deliver targeted energy through a single pin or three pin needle into the skin. Each of the micro-needles is partially insulated, which minimizes unnecessary damage to surrounding tissue, reducing recovery time. As we age, changes to our face and body happen \u2013 pockets of fat become more prominent, we lose volume, and our skin becomes looser. This sculpting tool gives us the ability to tighten and remove fat utilizing a combination of minimally invasive needling tips that can revitalize your skin to a more youthful looking you. Great for all areas including under the eyes, around the jowls, chin, arms, abdominals, legs, and anywhere you want fat removed permanently!"
